Fix drupal/groupmedia 4.0.8 (and 4.0.7): help page fatal error and a missing import.

The Group 2 -> 3 rename ("content" -> "relationships") was applied by
find-and-replace and also changed two things it should not have:
- groupmedia_help() calls file_get_relationships(), which does not exist, so
  /admin/help/groupmedia throws "Call to undefined function". Use
  file_get_contents() again.
- MediaReference uses GroupRelationshipInterface without importing it, so the
  name resolves to Drupal\groupmedia\Plugin\MediaFinder\GroupRelationshipInterface;
  `instanceof` against that missing class is always FALSE and the "skip the
  media we just added to the group" check never matches. Import the Group class.

Both are still present in 4.0.8 and on 4.0.x; no drupal.org issue yet.

